      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "349b0cd7-9b62-45c5-9313-f4dd68899849",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotel\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional tour manager\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EReturn Channel ferry crossings\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "fd6563e0-74f4-4bd2-aac8-fae3d0d8dd3f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights on half board basis at the 4* Best Western Plus Alize Hotel in Mouscron. Facilities at the hotel include a bar, gymnasium and sauna. All rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "fdaff8dd-8ca5-483a-bb49-57294c4a631b",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Lille\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPalais des Beaux Arts de Lille - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVilla Cavrois\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETourcoing Botanical Gardens\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMus\u00E9e Louvre-Lens - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELa Piscine Mus\u00E9e d\u0026#39;Art et d\u0026#39;Industrie, Roubaix\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "3989397f-014f-4163-9c89-e49c5c762a66",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMus\u00E9e des Beaux Arts, Tournai - designed by Victor Horta and opened in 1928, this Art Nouveau museum houses the modern art collection of the Brussels patron of the arts Henri Van Cutsem including impressionist works by Manet, Monet, Seurat and Van Gogh\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMus\u00E9e des Beaux Arts d\u2019Arras - its wide ranging collection has been housed for 200 years within the Benedictine abbey of Saint- Vaast, completely rebuilt in 1754 under the orders of Armand Gaston de Rohan\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMus\u00E9e de la Chartreuse in Douai - guided tour of the art museum housed in a former Carthusian convent dating as far back as 1559\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "21dabee3-34ef-49cf-98fc-6d87244da289",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Mouscron\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoard our private executive coach at your designated pick up points \u2013 take the cross Channel ferry from your preferred port (or travel by Eurostar from London St Pancras or Ashford International to Lille - supplement payable) \u2013 continue on to the 4* Best Western Plus Alize Hotel in Mouscron.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Guided tour of Lille \u0026amp; guided tour of Palais des Beaux Arts de Lille\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided walking tour of Lille takes in sights such as the Palais Rihour, the Main Square, the Opera House, the Old Stock Exchange and the Notre Dame de la Treille Cathedral \u2013 guided tour of the Palais des Beaux Arts de Lille, considered one of France\u2019s most important galleries with a wonderful collection including Flemish and 17th century Dutch paintings and grand altarpieces by Rubens and Van Dyck.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Villa Cavrois \u0026amp; Tourcoing Botanical Gardens\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVilla Cavrois, designed by Robert Mallet-Stevens and constructed in Croix between 1929 and 1932 for Paul Cavrois, is a contemporary ch\u00E2teau combining classical design and modernist aesthetics and one of the most famous works of modern architecture in France \u2013 Tourcoing Botanical Gardens, with its formal garden and English section created in 1917, offers a rich variety of plants such as acacia, yew and black pine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Mus\u00E9e Louvre-Lens\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMade up of four buildings which its creators intended to resemble four boats, carefully docked alongside one another, a guided tour of the Mus\u00E9e Louvre-Lens introduces us to the collection of objects loaned to it from the Mus\u00E9e du Louvre in Paris \u2013 the afternoon is free in Lens to explore the wonderful Art Deco architecture of the town.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 La Piscine Mus\u00E9e d\u0026#39;Art et d\u0026#39;Industrie, Roubaix\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELa Piscine Mus\u00E9e d\u0026#39;Art et d\u0026#39;Industrie, an Art Deco municipal swimming pool built between 1927 and 1932, is an architectural masterpiece now showcasing fine arts, applied arts and sculpture \u2013 continue for our Channel crossing back to the UK and then return to our original departure points with comfort stops en route.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
